  54:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/sha512.c **** /*
  55:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/sha512.c ****  * Best performance comes from most recent compilers, with intrinsics and -O3.
  56:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/sha512.c ****  * Must compile with -march=armv8.2-a+sha3, but we can't detect armv8.2-a, and
  57:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/sha512.c ****  * can't always detect __ARM_FEATURE_SHA512 (notably clang 7-12).
